 "whoFoundIt": {
  "FIX145": "the same pin went stale TWICE IN FIVE DAYS on legal-design-packet-set-manifests.json, and no counter reported either time. It proved its own re-pin safe by comparing all 497 packetSets entries between the anchored blob and its base: 6 differ, none of its families.",
  "FIX146": "three COMPLETE_PACKET_PROVEN Louisiana families pin five, five and two committed records -- including LA.memo.json and the track registry, the records their own eligibility recitals are generated from -- at digests no longer in the tree.",
  "andMine": "SHARED_LEDGER_CANNOT_BE_PINNED_BY_WHOLE_FILE_DIGEST.json recorded the shape; this is the census."
 },
